HDSL is an independent, unofficial launcher for DeepSeek Harness.

The navigation and page organization are inspired by Hello Minecraft! Launcher
(HMCL), copyright its respective authors and contributors. The Java HDSL and
HMCL-rs projects informed the product design. No code or graphical assets from
those reference projects are included in this repository.

DeepSeek Harness is developed by DeepSeek AI. Names are used to identify the
software managed by this launcher; no endorsement is implied.

